  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of Territoires Durables</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of Danish co-financing of Territoires Durables. 

The BMZ has tasked GIZ with developing a new programme, along the existing priorities and building on established partnerships. The new program will have a focus on &quot;sustainable living conditions&quot; in the rural areas affected by the earthquake. It is expected to be a program that focuses on agriculture and infrastructure, including water (approx. EUR 8 million). Denmark wants to contribute approximately EUR 4 million to this program, bringing the total to EUR 12 million</narrative>
  </description>
